Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.01,0:01:52.39,op_zh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(100,100)}\h閉嘴{\rop_ja}　{\r\blur3}我已然在等待
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.39,0:01:55.27,op_zh,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(100,100)}已經沒有什麼可怕
